<title>CROATIA: Croatian unemployment rises to 18.2 pct in July.</title>
<headline>Croatian unemployment rises to 18.2 pct in July.</headline>
<dateline>ZAGREB 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Central Bureau of Statistics and Ministry of Labour issued the following economic indicator details. Previous figures in brackets.</p>
<p> CROATIA UNEMPLOYMENT	  JULY	  JUNE	 JULY '95</p>
<p> Total jobless		  257,133     252,524	263,523</p>
<p> Unemployment rate (pct)     18.2	  17.9	 16.7(16.9)</p>
<p>NOTES -- Total workforce figures are being constantly revised to include private sector, but they exclude army, police and farmers. Data exclude unemployed in Serb-held territory. -- Kolumbina Bencevic, Zagreb Newsroom, 385-1-4557075</p>
</text>
